Subject: [PATCH] docs: add OpenSSF best practices badge (#51)

Adds the OpenSSF Best Practices badge to the README, signaling that
the project follows recommended OSS practices (CI, license, etc.).

The badge links to https://bestpractices.coreinfrastructure.org/
where projects self-assess against a checklist of OSS best practices.

Closes #51.

