 [![Coverage](https://img.shields.io/codecov/c/github/tofuutils/tenv?token=RPW5OYQS0Q)](https://codecov.io/gh/tofuutils/tenv)
+[![OpenSSF Best Practices](https://www.bestpractices.dev/projects/7585/badge)](https://www.bestpractices.dev/projects/7585)
